# Demo residue. examples/01_basics.py persists to a RELATIVE path, and the suite used to run the examples
# with cwd=<repo>, so every run appended to this file -- 85 runs of the same demo, 340 records, 337 of them
# superseded, COMMITTED. A fresh clone running our flagship "a correction stays corrected" example printed
# a wall of duplicates before reaching the one active line. The file is generated; it does not belong here.
memory.json
